There is a lot of sunshine this morning.
The weather is very warm.
I wear new clothes today.
I put on my new blue kurta.
This kurta is cotton.
It is very good and loose.
I like this blue colour very much.
I take my bag.
I step out of the house.
I walk to the BEST bus stop.
There is bright sunshine outside.
But I do not feel hot today.
This cotton kurta feels cool to the body.
I feel very fresh.
My red bus arrives.
This bus is very big.
I get on the bus.
I am now ready for the Mumbai summer.
I go to the office.
